  "details": "I feel uncomfortable leaving an instance abruptly.\n\nSo, when leave the instance by join to other instance, logout, return to home, I would like to see a 5 second countdown above my head so that other users can see it.\n\nI would like the countdown to be displayed on myself as well.\n\nIf the countdown is in progress, it would be nice to be able to cancel the instance move in some way.",
